秦岭山区3～12厘米。此次过程雨雪相态复杂，伴有雨雪转换，受其影响，陕北大部、关中北部、秦巴山区道路湿滑、积雪结冰、低能见度风险高。影响区域的交通、铁路、航空、电力、通讯、设施农业将受到影响，建议相关部门备齐应急物资设备，随时做好应急启动、响应、处置的准备。积雪可能导致风光设施和输电线路产生结冰、光电设施积雪覆盖，同时易导致简易搭建物、设施大棚、体育馆等大跨度建筑垮塌，建议提前巡检加固，及时清除积雪结冰，加强交通安全和城市运行应急管理工作。","LanguageCode":"zh-cn","Summary":"暴雪蓝色预警 生效，持续时间至 星期二，8:43上午 CST。来源：国家预警信息发布中心"}],"HaveReadyStatements":true,"MobileLink":"http://m.weathercn.com/zh/cn/xian/106566/weather-warnings/106566?lang=zh-cn","Link":"http://m.weathercn.com/zh/cn/xian/106566/weather-warnings/106566?lang=zh-cn"}],"checkedAt":1794788485669},"/alerts/v1/60461.json":{"data":[{"CountryCode":"CN","AlertID":102915976,"Description":{"Localized":"大雾黄色预警","English":"Yellow Warning for Dense Fog"},"Category":"NON-PRECIPITATION","Priority":264,"Type":"大雾","TypeID":"CN364","Class":null,"Level":"黄色","AlarmLevel":"Yellow","Color":{"Name":"Yellow","Red":255,"Green":255,"Blue":0,"Hex":"#FFFF00"},"Source":"国家预警信息发布中心","SourceId":62,"Disclaimer":null,"Area":[{"Name":"宝鸡市","StartTime":"2026-11-15T21:05:00+08:00","EpochStartTime":1794747900,"EndTime":"2026-11-16T09:05:00+08:00","EpochEndTime":1794791100,"LastAction":{"Localized":"更新","English":"Update"},"Text":"宝鸡市气象台2026年11月15日21时05分继续发布大雾黄色预警信号：预计下述地区未来12小时内将出现能见度小于500米的雾：渭滨区、眉县、太白县、凤县，请注意防范。","LanguageCode":"zh-cn","Summary":"大雾黄色预警 生效，持续时间至 9:05上午 CST。来源：国家预警信息发布中心"}],"HaveReadyStatements":true,"MobileLink":"http://m.weathercn.com/zh/cn/baoji/60461/weather-warnings/60461?lang=zh-cn","Link":"http://m.weathercn.com/zh/cn/baoji/60461/weather-warnings/60461?lang=zh-cn"},{"CountryCode":"CN","AlertID":102915700,"Description":{"Localized":"暴雪蓝色预警","English":"Blue Warning for Blizzard"},"Category":"WINTER","Priority":299,"Type":"暴雪","TypeID":"CN295","Class":null,"Level":"蓝色","AlarmLevel":"Blue","Color":{"Name":"Blue","Red":0,"Green":0,"Blue":255,"Hex":"#0000FF"},"Source":"国家预警信息发布中心","SourceId":62,"Disclaimer":null,"Area":[{"Name":"宝鸡市","StartTime":"2026-11-15T17:43:00+08:00","EpochStartTime":1794735780,"EndTime":"2026-11-17T08:43:00+08:00","Epoch